{"version":1,"content":"<p>意大利南部貨車司機不滿燃料價格上漲及生活成本高企發起示威並封鎖道路，導致工廠原料供應中斷，嚴重威脅當地意粉生產。</p><p>有兩間產品在香港超市有售的意粉生產商均表示受到影響。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T10:20:07.445176+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":83,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T09:57:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T11:37:43.449619+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T10:17:38.727232+00:00","content_hash":"836c1dbcd3df172d4a8c54c24a20765622cd8e4eb866b2acf52e36afe3a4e06c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}